{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And rule over the fish of the sea</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: וירדו גת פלשתים (and the Philistines descended upon Gath). If you merit, you will rule even over the fish of the sea; and if not, ירדו גת — meaning, you will be subjugated to the Philistines."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:28.439336648Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}